sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant ShipmentService
  participant OrderService
  participant Order
  participant Shipment

  Note over Customer: Customer opens shipment tracking screen and inputs tracking number or order ID

  Customer->>ShipmentService: getTrackingDetails(trackingNumber)

  alt Shipment not found
    Note over ShipmentService: Query database for shipment by tracking number
    ShipmentService-->>Customer: throw Error("Shipment not found")
  else Shipment found
    Note over ShipmentService: Fetch associated Order and status timeline
    ShipmentService->>OrderService: getOrderById(orderId)
    OrderService-->>ShipmentService: orderEntity

    Note over ShipmentService, Order: Read status history records from order
    Note over ShipmentService, Shipment: Read current delivery progress and failed attempts count

    ShipmentService-->>Customer: Shipment tracking summary (current status, history timeline, shipper details)
    Note over Customer: View real-time tracking timeline and estimated status
  end
